{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2022-11-15 06:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT ANNOUNCES THIRD QUARTER RESULTS; REAFFIRMS FISCAL 2022 GUIDANCE', 'text': "ATLANTA , NOV. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE HOME DEPOT®, THE WORLD'S LARGEST HOME IMPROVEMENT RETAILER, TODAY REPORTED SALES OF $38.9 BILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022, AN INCREASE OF $2.1 BILLION, OR 5.6 PERCENT FROM THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2021. COMPARABLE SALES FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022 INCREASED 4.3 PERCENT, AND COMPARABLE SALES IN THE U.S. INCREASED 4.5 PERCENT."}